<body>

<header>
    <h1>🧪 Science Experiment Report</h1>
    <p>Educational HTML Project</p>
</header>

<hr>

<main>

<section>

    <h2>🔬 Experiment Title</h2>

    <p>
        Observing the Effect of Temperature on Water
        Evaporation.
    </p>

</section>

<section>

    <h2>🎯 Objective</h2>

    <p>
        To observe how temperature can affect the rate
        at which water evaporates.
    </p>

</section>

<section>

    <h2>🧰 Materials</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Two containers</li>
        <li>Water</li>
        <li>Measuring cup</li>
        <li>Timer</li>
        <li>Thermometer</li>
    </ul>

</section>

<section>

    <h2>📋 Procedure</h2>

    <ol>
        <li>Fill two containers with equal amounts of water.</li>
        <li>Place them under different conditions.</li>
        <li>Observe them for a fixed period.</li>
        <li>Record the observations.</li>
    </ol>

</section>

<section>

    <h2>📊 Observation</h2>

    <table border="1" cellpadding="10">

        <tr>
            <th>Condition</th>
            <th>Initial Amount</th>
            <th>Final Amount</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Room Temperature</td>
            <td>100 ml</td>
            <td>90 ml</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Warm Environment</td>
            <td>100 ml</td>
            <td>75 ml</td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</section>

<section>

    <h2>📝 Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        The sample observation suggests that temperature
        can influence evaporation.
    </p>

</section>

</main>

</body>
</html>
